) were used to assess stratum-specific differences in TPT initiation and completion rates.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"TPT completion rates were calculated as the number of TPT completions in a 6-month period\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Analysis of TPT initiation rates among ART-naive clients included only those initiating TPT within 6 months of ART initiation.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"TPT initiation and completion rates were aggregated across all PEPFAR-supported programs.\"}], \"confidence\": \"medium\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"outcome_types\", \"analytic_depth\"]}", "type": "text"}]}